,"Clara Camblor","Raynaldo Houy Delattre","Claude Djian","Sébastien Portier","Laurence Dubard de Gaillarbois","Vanessa Liautey","Stéphanie Marc","Delphine Benja","Ernaut Vivien","Elsa Agnès","Stéphane Roux","Oscar Valero","Michel Moutardier","Françoise Muranyi-Kovacs","Moni Grego","Mohamed Bounay","Farid Bendali","Caroline Cano","Abdelkader Laslah","Pascale Dubois","Marceau Chappey","Louison Chappey","Marie-Christine Jeanney","Olivia Forest","Marcel Camilleri","Clara Guipont","Vincent Leenhardt","Sam Olivier","Fabrice Raspati","Mike Reilles","David Ayala","Raphaël Bianchin","Jean-Baptiste Epiard","Jade Amoussou","Youri Picard","Capucine Ducastelle","Marie-Claire Durand","Jean-Marc Lacaze","Alicia Le Breton","Norah Cassagnabere","Emilie Aubertot","Lan Qiu","Sandrine Barciet","Mathias Labelle","Collin Hill","Camille Soulerin","Christelle Golovine","Bénédicte Engelibert","José da Silva","Yvette Caldas","Marc Baylet Delperier","Emmanuel Suarez","Sandrine Le Metayer","Amélie Robin","Antoine Oppenheim","Christophe Ntakabanyura","Annie Pérez","David Legrain","Marie-Laurence Tartas","Anouk Feral","Stéphane Benazet","Elisa Sergent","Nicolas Chupin","Victor Assié","Adèle Simphal","Evelyne Cervera","Renan Pacheco"],"screenwriters":["Brigitte Peskine","Fabienne Facco","Olivier Laneurie","Elsa Marpeau","Manon Dillys","Sébastien Le Délézir","Jean-Marie Chavent","Thomas Luntz","Alexandra Julhiet","Kristel Mudry","Agathe Robilliard","Solen Roy-Pagenault","Ivan Piettre","Marine Rambach","Anne Rambach","Robin Barataud","Marie-Alice Gadéa","Marc Kressmann","Virginie Parietti","Stéphane Brisset","Pascal Lahmani","Pascal Perbet","Éric Eider","Killian Arthur","Jérémie Marcus","Thomas Fecchio"],"cinematographers":["Philippe Lardon","Serge Dell'Amico","Ludovic Colbeau-Justin","Pierre Milon"],"composers":["Vincent Stora"],"reviews":[{"author":"quokam","text":"Sejde se lesba, cernoch a (do spolecnosti plne integrovany, liberalni) muslim u jednoho stolu. To neni zacatek anektody (nebo kdo vi, treba je), ale serial, ktery az moc tlaci na pilu korektnosti. Hlavni hrdinka je, na svuj vek, ocividne citove nevyzrala osobnost, az se clivek divi, ze prosla psychotesty. Ale divat se na to da, takova mila oddechovka. Nektere dily vsak se do romkom polohy preklapi az moc (kupr vymena tel). Nevhybi ani dil s variaci Sveta pod hlavou. 6/10.(10.06.2026)","stars":3},{"author":"Chudobka","text":"Nekoukatelné. První epizoda mě odradila nejen nesympatickou hlavní hrdinkou, ale také hrozným ozvučením. Zkusila jsem se ještě pak podívat, ale dlouho jsem nevydržela. Roztrhl se nám pytel s ženami vyšetřovatelkami, tato je absolutně nejhorší. Čtyři děti, žádný problém, zvládne všechno. To bych chtěla vidět. Její vyšetřovací metody jsou podivné, dělá to na mě dojem, že ji musí osvítit duch svatý. Zlatá Imma T.(16.10.2025)","stars":1},{"author":"vladi3","text":"Mama mala zlomenu nohu, takze pri HO som to musela pocuvat ako podmaz. Neskutocna kravina. Hlupy a naivny scenar a hlavna hrdinka je povahovo nesympaticka krava. Herecka je sice sympaticka, ale ani zdaleka taka sexica ako ju tam prezentuju. Riesenie pripadov nema ani hlavu ani patu a casto nelogicke patranie sa nejakym zazrakom dostane k vyrieseniu.(08.09.2023)","stars":null}],"vods":[{"platform":"Oneplay","url":"https://www.oneplay.cz/porad/24568-inspektorka-candice-renoirova"},{"platform":"iVysílání","url":"https://www.ceskatelevize.cz/porady/16887964104-inspektorka-candice-renoirova?utm_source=csfd&utm_medium=section_vod&utm_campaign=link"},{"platform":"Telly","url":"https://telly.cz/program/policajtka-barbie/"},{"platform":"SledovaniTV","url":"https://sledovanitv.cz/epg/event/ct1svc:2026-07-01-93ccc206d6bf9145afac0cca6b60322f"},{"platform":"Lepší.TV","url":"https://www.lepsi.tv/top_tv/serial/inspektorka-candice-renoirova-online?utm_source=csfd&utm_content=csfd"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/387541-policajtka-barbie/prehled/","csfd_id":387541,"root_id":387541,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":nul